u-recreation-fitness-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Recreation and Fitness Center","title":"Try a short recreation session","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · North end of the Breezeway","notes":"Bring your Owl Card, tour the available fitness areas, and ask the Rec Desk about equipment checkout before planning a longer workout.","short_summary":"An active stop for learning how student recreation access works.","evidence_claim":"FAU says registered students receive semester access through required activity and service fees, while entry requires a valid Owl Card, membership pass, or approved scan.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/campusrec/about/facilities/","source_title":"Facilities | Campus Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Access is restricted to eligible students and members. The fitness floor requires users to be at least 18 and wear appropriate workout attire.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-owlexpress-boca-shuttle","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"OwlExpress Boca Campus Shuttle","title":"Ride one campus loop","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Boca Raton shuttle route","notes":"Use one shuttle ride to connect landmarks you have already seen, then save the official route page for future campus crossings.","short_summary":"A practical transit exercise for understanding distances across the Boca Raton campus.","evidence_claim":"Florida Atlantic maintains an official Boca Campus Shuttle page for OwlExpress service and identifies the Breezeway among the campus route information.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/parking/bocacampusshuttle/","source_title":"Boca Campus Shuttle","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Consult the official page for the current route and operating schedule before waiting; service availability can vary by academic calendar.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizner-park-boca-raton","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Mizner Park","title":"Take an evening fountain walk","subtitle":"Saturday evening · Downtown Boca Raton","notes":"Walk the illuminated paths, use the benches near the decorative fountains, and follow posted park rules while exploring downtown.","short_summary":"A public evening walk among fountains, paths, pavilions, and downtown streetscape.","evidence_claim":"The City of Boca Raton lists Mizner Park at Federal Highway and Mizner Boulevard with fountains, walking paths, pavilions, benches, lighting, and hours from sunrise to 2 a.m.","source_url":"https://www.myboca.us/2867/Mizner-Park","source_title":"Mizner Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The city lists the park as open sunrise–2 a.m. Alcohol and smoking are prohibited; parking includes metered spaces.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gumbo-limbo-nature-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Gumbo Limbo Nature Center","title":"Explore the coastal boardwalk","subtitle":"Sunday morning · Barrier island","notes":"Walk the coastal-forest boardwalk, climb Jacob’s Outlook if conditions allow, and leave wildlife undisturbed throughout the visit.","short_summary":"A marine and coastal-habitat stop connected to FAU research and local conservation.","evidence_claim":"The City of Boca Raton describes Gumbo Limbo as a 20-acre coastal preserve with a boardwalk, butterfly garden, outdoor aquariums, Jacob’s Outlook, and an FAU research gallery.","source_url":"https://www.myboca.us/2485/Gumbo-Limbo-Nature-Center","source_title":"Gumbo Limbo Nature Center","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":n