 return to once the semester gets moving.","short_summary":"A practical first look at FAU’s central community and involvement building.","evidence_claim":"FAU describes the Boca Raton Student Union as its campus center for community and leadership, with programs, facilities, services, and an eSports Arena Gaming Center.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/studentunion/","source_title":"Student Union","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Building services and individual activities may follow separate schedules or access rules; check the Union’s current information.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-atlantic-dining-hall","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Atlantic Dining Hall","title":"Pause for an on-campus meal","subtitle":"Friday evening · Student Union","notes":"Use this stop to learn where the main dining hall sits and ask staff about dietary needs before relying on it during a busy week.","short_summary":"A meal break that also establishes the location of FAU’s primary dining hall.","evidence_claim":"FAU identifies Atlantic Dining Hall as an all-you-can-eat facility in the Boca Raton Student Union, open to the FAU community and visitors.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/business-services/dining-locations/atlantic-dining-hall/","source_title":"Atlantic Dining Hall","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A meal swipe or payment is required; the official page lists Owl Card funds, meal swipes, cash, and credit cards as payment methods.","cost_status":"purchase_required","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-se-wimberly-library","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"S. E. Wimberly Library","title":"Learn the library entry routine","subtitle":"Saturday morning · Boca Raton campus","notes":"Enter through the public-facing library route, find the service points, and remember that student study rooms have narrower eligibility.","short_summary":"A low-pressure walkthrough of the campus’s principal library and its access rules.","evidence_claim":"FAU Libraries provides dedicated Wimberly Library information for guests and states that study rooms are limited to currently enrolled FAU or Palm Beach State students and employees.","source_url":"https://library.fau.edu/guest","source_title":"Welcome Guest","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-13","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Public visitors should review current library hours and entry rules; student and employee eligibility applies to study-room use.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-ritter-art-gallery","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Ritter Art Gallery","title":"Add a gallery stop upstairs","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Second-floor Breezeway","notes":"Follow campus signage to the second-floor gallery, check the current exhibition first, and pair the visit with a Breezeway walk.","short_summary":"A compact arts stop that introduces one of FAU’s named exhibition spaces.","evidence_claim":"FAU locates Ritter Art Gallery in building AG-39 on the second floor of the Breezeway near the library and publishes visitor directions and parking guidance.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/artsandletters/galleries/about/directions/","source_title":"Directions | University Galleries","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Confirm the current exhibition and gallery schedule before visiting; parking charges may apply outside designated free programming periods.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-recreation-fitness-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Recreation and Fitness Center","title":"Try a short recreation session","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · North end of the Breezeway","notes":"Bring your Owl Card, tour the available fitness areas, and ask the Rec Desk about equipment checkout before planning a longer workout.","short_summary":"An active stop for learning how student recreation access works.","evidence_claim":"FAU says registered students receive semester access through required activity and service fees, while entry requires a valid Owl Card, membership pass, or approved scan.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/campusrec/about/facilities/","source_title":"Facilities | Campus Recreation","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Access is restricted to eligible students and members. The fitness floor requires users to be at least 18 and wear appropriate workout attire.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"fau-owlexpress-boca-shuttle","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"OwlExpress Boca Campus Shuttle","title":"Ride one campus loop","subtitle":"Saturday afternoon · Boca Raton shuttle route","notes":"Use one shuttle ride to connect landmarks you have already seen, then save the official route page for future campus crossings.","short_summary":"A practical transit exercise for understanding distances across the Boca Raton campus.","evidence_claim":"Florida Atlantic maintains an official Boca Campus Shuttle page for OwlExpress service and identifies the Breezeway among the campus route information.","source_url":"https://www.fau.edu/parking/bocacampusshuttle/","source_title":"Boca Campus Shuttle","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Consult the official page for the current route and operating schedule before waiting; service availability can vary by academic calendar.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"mizner-park-boca-raton","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Mizner Park","title":"Take an evening fountain walk","subtitle":"Saturday evening · Downtown Boca Raton","notes":"Walk the illuminated paths, use the benches near the decorative fountains, and follow posted park rules while exploring downtown.","short_summary":"A public evening walk among fountains, paths, pavilions, and downtown streetscape.","evidence_claim":"The City of Boca Raton lists Mizner Park at Federal Highway and Mizner Boulevard with fountains, walking paths, pavilions, benches, lighting, and hours from sunrise to 2 a.m.","source_url":"https://www.myboca.us/2867/Mizner-Park","source_title":"Mizner Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The city lists the park as open sunrise–2 a.m. Alcohol and smoking are prohibited; parking includes metered spaces.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"gumbo-limbo-nature-center","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Gumbo Limbo Nature Center","title":"Explore the coastal boardwalk","subtitle":"Sunday morning · Barrier island","notes":"Walk the coastal-forest boardwalk, climb Jacob’s Outlook if conditions allow, and leave wildlife undisturbed throughout the visit.","short_summary":"A marine and coastal-habitat stop connected to FAU research and local conservation.","evidence_claim":"The City of Boca Raton describes Gumbo Limbo as a 20-acre coastal preserve with a boardwalk, butterfly garden, outdoor aquariums, Jacob’s Outlook, and an FAU research gallery.","source_url":"https://www.myboca.us/2485/Gumbo-Limbo-Nature-Center","source_title":"Gumbo Limbo Nature Center","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"The city currently lists trails, boardwalk, and tower from 7 a.m. to sunset; aquarium and gallery schedules differ. Groups require reservations.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"spanish-river-park","subject_type":"sequence_stop","entity_name":"Spanish River Park","title":"Finish beside the Atlantic","subtitle":"Sunday afternoon · Spanish River Park","notes":"Use the park’s designated beach access, check posted water and weather conditions, and keep the final stop within guarded public areas.","short_summary":"A straightforward oceanfront finale at a named city park near campus.","evidence_claim":"The City of Boca Raton’s official facility page states that Spanish River Park provides access to the beach and Atlantic Ocean.","source_url":"https://www.myboca.us/facilities/facility/details/spanishriverpark-55","source_title":"Spanish River Park","source_kind":"government","source_published_at":null,"source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Review current city notices, beach conditions, facility hours, and parking requirements before departure; follow all posted safety directions.","cost_status":"unknown","under21_safe":true}],"warnings":["Schedules, exhibitions, shuttle service, recreation eligibility, parking charges, and coastal conditions can change; the linked direct sources should be rechecked before each stop.","Coordinates and map URLs are null where they were not independently verified from a direct authoritative page during this research pass."]}],"warnings":[]}
